  - `node` v26.10.0, `npm` 11.19.1, `npx` and `curl` are installed. No global Tailwind package is present.
  - The script header says to run it after changing anything under `internal/web/templates/` (lines 8-9). It is never part of `go build`/`go test` (lines 4-6).
- **Tailwind only scans templates.** `@source "../templates"` (`internal/web/assets/input.css:12`). Class names assembled dynamically, such as `chip-{{ .Priority }}` or `dot-{{ .Status }}`, work only because they are defined as component classes in `input.css` (`input.css:6-8`): chips at lines 20-29, `.dot-todo`/`.dot-in_progress`/`.dot-done` at lines 31-34, `.card`/`.card-live`/`.card-blocked` at lines 36-41, `.column` at lines 43-45, `.meta` at line 46, `.copy-btn` at lines 48-52.
